; Stated rather than inherited. Godot defaults to 45 degrees, which sits between
; the navigation agent's 38 and the authored banks' 48-to-58 — so the player could
; scramble up ground the enemies could not path over, and "that way is closed"
; stopped being a rule the level could rely on. Matched to navigation instead,
; with a shade of slack so nothing the enemies can walk is barred to the player.
floor_max_angle = 0.6981317
script = ExtResource("1_controller")

